# Normalise line endings.
#
# core.autocrlf is true on this machine, so a checkout rewrote every text
# file to CRLF while prettier defaults to endOfLine "lf" -- which meant a
# fresh clone failed `npm run lint` with ~6,500 errors before anyone had
# touched a line of code. This pins LF in the working tree on every
# platform, so the tooling and the checkout agree.
#
# eol=lf rather than relaxing prettier to "auto": the repo already stores
# LF, and letting each machine keep its own endings is how a whitespace-only
# diff ends up inside an otherwise clean change.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touch these, whatever the content sniffer thinks.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
